## Variables and types

| Code | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `let x = 5;` / `let mut x = 5;` | Immutable / mutable variable |
| `let x: u64 = 5;` `const MAX: u32 = 100;` | Type annotation; a constant (type required) |
| `i8 i16 i32 i64 i128 isize`, `u8 ... usize` | Signed and unsigned integers (`usize` for indexes and lengths) |
| `f64`, `bool`, `char` (`'é'`, 4 bytes) | Float, boolean, Unicode character |
| `x as f64`, `u8::try_from(n)` | Cast; checked conversion returning `Result` |
| `(1, "a")`, `t.0`, `let (a, b) = t;` | Tuple, field, destructuring |
| `[0; 5]`, `[1, 2, 3]` | Arrays of fixed length |
| `checked_add`, `saturating_sub`, `wrapping_mul` | Arithmetic that cannot overflow silently |

